A preview.screenshot(url:str outputPath?:str fullPage?:bool width?:320..3840 height?:240..2160 waitFor?:str delayMs?:0..10000 waitUntil?:json:"{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"domcontentloaded\",\"load\",\"networkidle\"]}") -> {path:str width:int height:int ..} ! -- Write one PNG and return its path, size and SHA-256
