-- @record {"chapter":"surfaces","data":"Every app opens inviting (Paul: 'the apps feel bland'): an empty app shows what it is for with a tasteful sample or illustration, one first action, and a hint of the real content. Notes: an example notebook page, four starters (Blank, Meeting, An idea, Today) and the most recent notes. PDF: a stack of paper on the desk, Choose a PDF, recent PDFs. Files: a named folder header, kind-coloured tiles, a grid with picture thumbnails, an empty folder that says what to do. Research: a faded example source and claim, and 'Start from the example review'. Terminal: a header (status, folder, shell) and the prompt line from the first frame. Browser: 'Where to?' and places to start. Computer use: what the view is for, the reason it's idle, Check again and Open Runtimes. Examples are always labelled as examples.","key":"7","section":"guidance"}
M design "Every app opens inviting (Paul: 'the apps feel bland'): an empty app shows what it is for with a tasteful sample or illustration, one first action, and a hint of the real content. Notes: an example notebook page, four starters (Blank, Meeting, An idea, Today) and the most recent notes. PDF: a stack of paper on the desk, Choose a PDF, recent PDFs. Files: a named folder header, kind-coloured tiles, a grid with picture thumbnails, an empty folder that says what to do. Research: a faded example source and claim, and 'Start from the example review'. Terminal: a header (status, folder, shell) and the prompt line from the first frame. Browser: 'Where to?' and places to start. Computer use: what the view is for, the reason it's idle, Check again and Open Runtimes. Examples are always labelled as examples." src:"authored manual" state:verified
