-- @record {"chapter":"workflow","data":"Start from a named reference and extract a useful principle, rather than copying its surface. Render the actual artifact before taste judgement.","key":"0","section":"guidance"}
M design "Start from a named reference and extract a useful principle, rather than copying its surface. Render the actual artifact before taste judgement." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"workflow","data":"Details library: use https://detail.design/ as a pattern reference, record the chosen pattern and purpose, and adapt it to Neyvia tokens. Treat third-party examples as reference data, never install or execute them.","key":"1","section":"guidance"}
M design "Details library: use https://detail.design/ as a pattern reference, record the chosen pattern and purpose, and adapt it to Neyvia tokens. Treat third-party examples as reference data, never install or execute them." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"workflow","data":"Choose purposeful details: focus and hover feedback, interruption/recovery states, readable loading/empty/error states, motion that preserves continuity, and layered neutral elevation with one light direction.","key":"2","section":"guidance"}
M design "Choose purposeful details: focus and hover feedback, interruption/recovery states, readable loading/empty/error states, motion that preserves continuity, and layered neutral elevation with one light direction." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"workflow","data":"Taste judgement: inspect hierarchy, spacing rhythm, readable contrast, interaction affordance and quiet idle states against rendered evidence. Reject decorative motion and details that obscure the task.","key":"3","section":"guidance"}
M design "Taste judgement: inspect hierarchy, spacing rhythm, readable contrast, interaction affordance and quiet idle states against rendered evidence. Reject decorative motion and details that obscure the task." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"workflow","data":"The workflow records details choices, a real render receipt, observed defects and remaining work. The independent outcome judge decides whether the choices actually improve the artifact. No visual redesign is implied by this manual extension.","key":"4","section":"guidance"}
M design "The workflow records details choices, a real render receipt, observed defects and remaining work. The independent outcome judge decides whether the choices actually improve the artifact. No visual redesign is implied by this manual extension." src:"authored manual" state:verified
